                Why The Guide Can Matter More Than Tour Length
              </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="text-slate-700 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed space-y-4">
              <p>
                Two hours at Cu Chi can feel completely different depending on who is leading you.
              </p>
              <p>
                Travelers consistently report that the quality of their guide makes or breaks the visit. The site comes alive through clear storytelling—how ventilation shafts were disguised as termite mounds, how trapdoor seals kept smoke from rising, and how families managed underground life for weeks.
