                    <li>You return to your hotel by 12:30–01:00 PM with the afternoon ahead of you.</li>
                    <li>Trade-off: Requires an early alarm (around 06:00 AM) while on holiday.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs">
                  <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">🌇 Afternoon Tour (12:30–01:00 PM Departure)</div>
                  <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4 leading-relaxed">
                    <li>Sleep in, enjoy breakfast, and take your morning easy.</li>
                    <li>Afternoon visits can be quieter after morning tour groups leave, though crowd levels vary by day and season.</li>
                    <li>Trade-off: You walk the forest during the hottest hours of the day.</li>
